WEBVTT

00:00:10.357 --> 00:00:11.317
(YAWNS)

00:00:11.397 --> 00:00:13.757
Morning. It's morning, everyone.

00:00:13.837 --> 00:00:18.477
Today's the day. The sun is shining, the
tank is clean and we are getting out of...

00:00:18.597 --> 00:00:19.797
(GASPS) The tank is clean.

00:00:20.837 --> 00:00:22.557
The tank is clean!

00:00:23.637 --> 00:00:24.837
But how?

00:00:24.917 --> 00:00:27.837
Boss must have installed it
while we were sleeping.

00:00:27.917 --> 00:00:30.437
-What are we going to do?
-What's it say, Peach?

00:00:30.757 --> 00:00:31.717
(VOICE MUFFLED)

00:00:31.797 --> 00:00:33.597
I can't hear you, Peach.

00:00:33.677 --> 00:00:38.037
The Aqua Scum 2003 is an all-purpose,
self-cleaning salt-water purifier

00:00:38.117 --> 00:00:40.677
that extends
the life of your aquarium fish.

00:00:40.757 --> 00:00:41.877
Stop it!

00:00:41.957 --> 00:00:45.837
The Aqua Scum is programmed
to scan your tank every five minutes?

00:00:45.917 --> 00:00:47.637
Scan? What does that mean?

00:00:52.957 --> 00:00:55.717
AUTOMATED VOICE: Temperature
82 degrees, pH balance normal.

00:00:55.957 --> 00:00:57.037
Oooh!

00:00:57.117 --> 00:00:58.157
Nice.

00:00:59.757 --> 00:01:02.957
Curse you, Aqua Scum!

00:01:03.037 --> 00:01:06.397
-That's it for the escape plan.
-Then what are we going to do about...

00:01:06.957 --> 00:01:08.357
Darla!

00:01:08.437 --> 00:01:10.197
Stay down, kid.

00:01:12.517 --> 00:01:15.157
-False alarm.
-My nerves can't take much more.

00:01:15.357 --> 00:01:17.957
BLOAT: What are we going to do
when that brat gets here?

00:01:18.037 --> 00:01:20.717
-I'm thinking, I'm thinking.
-NEMO: Help!

00:01:20.837 --> 00:01:22.717
-Help me!
-Hold on. I'm coming.

00:01:22.837 --> 00:01:23.917
Help me!

00:01:23.997 --> 00:01:26.797
Swim down! Come on, kid. Swim down!

00:01:26.877 --> 00:01:29.237
-Everybody jump in.
-Swim down!

00:01:29.317 --> 00:01:30.837
What the...

00:01:31.837 --> 00:01:32.917
Good work.

00:01:33.437 --> 00:01:35.717
-Gill!
-Sharkbait!

00:01:37.277 --> 00:01:40.437
-Roll, kid! Lean, kid! Roll!
-Go to the window.

00:01:44.957 --> 00:01:47.277
SHERMAN: Whoops! That would
have been a nasty fall.

00:01:47.357 --> 00:01:50.317
-I don't want to go belly-up!
-Calm down, Nemo.

00:01:50.397 --> 00:01:52.677
You won't go belly-up. I promise.

00:01:52.757 --> 00:01:53.837
You're going to be okay.

00:01:57.957 --> 00:01:59.037
Darla!

00:02:04.037 --> 00:02:06.597
Do any of these boats
look familiar to you?

00:02:06.677 --> 00:02:08.957
No, but the boat has to be here.

00:02:09.037 --> 00:02:12.077
-We're going to find it.
-I'm totally excited.

00:02:12.157 --> 00:02:14.717
-(YAWNS) Are you excited?
-Dory, wake up. Come on.

00:02:15.717 --> 00:02:16.717
Duck!

00:02:17.877 --> 00:02:20.357
That's not a duck. It's a pelican!

00:02:29.757 --> 00:02:32.637
No! I didn't come this far
to be breakfast.

00:02:40.717 --> 00:02:43.157
Hey, Nigel. Would you look at that?

00:02:43.237 --> 00:02:44.237
What?

00:02:44.317 --> 00:02:47.597
Sun's barely up and Gerald's
had more than he can handle.

00:02:47.677 --> 00:02:50.877
Yeah. Reckon somebody
ought to help the poor guy.

00:02:51.277 --> 00:02:52.477
(MURMURS OF AGREEMENT)

00:02:52.597 --> 00:02:55.397
Well, don't everybody fly off at once!

00:02:57.397 --> 00:02:58.517
(RETCHES)

00:02:58.597 --> 00:03:00.637
All right, Gerald. What is it?

00:03:00.717 --> 00:03:02.477
Fish got your tongue?

00:03:02.997 --> 00:03:04.437
Love a duck!

00:03:04.837 --> 00:03:06.197
I've got to find my son Nemo.

00:03:06.917 --> 00:03:07.957
Nemo?

00:03:08.037 --> 00:03:11.957
He's that fish that's been
fighting the whole ocean.

00:03:12.037 --> 00:03:14.397
Hey, I know where your son...

00:03:15.677 --> 00:03:17.717
Wait. Come back.

00:03:17.797 --> 00:03:20.357
-Stop!
-Keep going. He's crazy.

00:03:20.437 --> 00:03:22.717
I've got something to tell you.

00:03:26.677 --> 00:03:27.717
Mine.

00:03:32.277 --> 00:03:36.037
Okay. Don't make any sudden moves.

00:03:36.117 --> 00:03:39.677
Hop inside my mouth if you want to live.

00:03:39.757 --> 00:03:43.877
Hop into your mouth?
And how does that make me live?

00:03:43.957 --> 00:03:48.117
-Mine?
-Because I can take you to your son.

00:03:48.197 --> 00:03:49.557
Yeah, right!

00:03:49.637 --> 00:03:53.997
No. I know your son. He's orange.
He's got a gimpy fin on one side.

00:03:54.077 --> 00:03:56.357
-That's Nemo!
-Mine! Mine! Mine!

00:03:59.237 --> 00:04:01.477
Fasten your seat belts!

00:04:02.317 --> 00:04:04.757
Mine! Mine! Mine!

00:04:07.637 --> 00:04:09.597
DORY: Whoo-hoo!

00:04:23.477 --> 00:04:25.397
Everybody hold on!

00:04:29.077 --> 00:04:31.317
Mine! Mine! Mine!

00:04:38.197 --> 00:04:39.957
-(FISH SCREAM)
-Too loud. Too loud for me.

00:04:40.037 --> 00:04:42.277
♪ Twinkle, twinkle, little star ♪

00:04:42.357 --> 00:04:45.157
Find a happy place.
Find a happy place!

00:04:45.837 --> 00:04:48.397
BARBARA:
Darla, your uncle will see you now.

00:04:50.277 --> 00:04:53.077
All right. Let's see those pearly whites.

00:04:53.637 --> 00:04:55.197
I'm a piranha.

00:04:55.277 --> 00:04:56.877
They're in the Amazon.

00:04:56.957 --> 00:05:00.437
And a piranha's a fish.
Just like your present.

00:05:02.237 --> 00:05:03.877
-DARLA: I got a fishy!
-Oh, no.

00:05:05.117 --> 00:05:06.357
Poor little guy.

00:05:06.517 --> 00:05:08.277
-He's dead.
-Sharkbait!

00:05:08.357 --> 00:05:10.077
Yay! Fishy, fishy, fishy!

00:05:10.157 --> 00:05:13.957
Must have left your present
in the car, sweetie. I'll go and get it.

00:05:14.037 --> 00:05:15.597
He's still alive!

00:05:15.677 --> 00:05:17.317
Why is he playing dead?

00:05:17.397 --> 00:05:19.157
He's going to
get flushed down the toilet.

00:05:19.237 --> 00:05:21.717
He's going to get out of here.

00:05:21.797 --> 00:05:25.717
-What a smart little guy.
-No, not the trash can!

00:05:26.997 --> 00:05:28.997
Hey! I found his dad.

00:05:29.077 --> 00:05:30.637
-Where's Nemo?
-Dentist!

00:05:30.717 --> 00:05:32.437
-He's over there.
-What's a dentist?

00:05:33.717 --> 00:05:36.157
-Get in there.
-I can't go in there.

00:05:36.237 --> 00:05:39.637
Oh, yes you can. Charge!

00:05:41.077 --> 00:05:42.477
-(SCREAMS)
-What the...

00:05:44.517 --> 00:05:46.437
Darla, sweetie, look out.

00:05:50.077 --> 00:05:53.077
Hold still. Easy, easy.

00:05:54.597 --> 00:05:55.957
Hold still!

00:05:56.037 --> 00:05:57.837
It's all right. Nobody's going to hurt you.

